{"availability":"available","full":"Dami904/steward","name":"steward","description":"An AI agent for the IXS RWA vault that has to earn its limits: deterministic policy envelope, on-chain earned-authority tiers, and a measured Vault Health Feed. OpenServ SERV Hackathon, RWA Vaults track.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-26T12:10:46Z","updated":"2026-09-27T13:29:17Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://steward-rwa.vercel.app","topics":["ai-agents","bsc","defi","erc-8004","foundry","hackathon","ixs","nextjs","onchain-verification","openserv","policy-engine","rwa","serv-hackathon","solidity","typescript","x402"],"demo":"https://steward-rwa.vercel.app/demo","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T12:27:17.498Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T12:27:17.498Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T12:27:17.498Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T10:32:18.434Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2104250842362839217","postId":"2104250842362839217","postedAt":"2026-09-27T16:44:30.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T20:03:31.245Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T10:32:18.434Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T12:27:17.498Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An AI agent can propose moving money, but can it prove what it was allowed to do, and can it earn more room over time instead of being handed it?","Steward is an OpenServ SERV Hackathon Edition 01 submission (RWA Vaults track, partner IXS Finance). An AI agent proposes deposit and redeem actions on IXS's real ManagedVault on BSC (0xc975a3EeF2e49F8eDdEf585340C43f15300fCB82). A deterministic policy engine, not the model, decides what is allowed. The agent's limits are tiers it earns from a replayable on-chain record of its own conduct, not constants an owner typed in. Vault liquidity is measured from chain history, not taken from documentation.","Unaudited. No real funds were spent and nothing is deployed to mainnet. Not financial advice. See What is real and what is simulated."],"features":["Real: the contracts and their tests; the policy engine (TypeScript and Python, checked","Simulated or staged: the USDC balances on the fork (impersonated from a public holder,","Not done: a live model driving the agent (the demo's actions are scripted; the model's"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dami904/steward/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5fcd7578a0a18ef771d0d1e8583a6cff27e1cb8df9ccd497cc981f85d392a7bd","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T08:18:59.089Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T10:32:18.434Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An AI agent can propose moving money, but can it prove what it was allowed to do, and can it earn more room over time instead of being handed it?","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dami904/steward/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"5fcd7578a0a18ef771d0d1e8583a6cff27e1cb8df9ccd497cc981f85d392a7bd","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dami904/steward/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T10:32:18.434Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-27T13:29:17Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dami904/steward/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T10:32:18.434Z","hash":"5fcd7578a0a18ef771d0d1e8583a6cff27e1cb8df9ccd497cc981f85d392a7bd","originalBytes":26629,"storedBytes":26629,"truncated":false},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://steward-rwa.vercel.app/demo","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T18:16:14.495Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T18:16:14.495Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-16T18:16:14.495Z","target":"https://steward-rwa.vercel.app/demo","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-23T18:16:14.495Z"},"previewCheck":{"url":"https://steward-rwa.vercel.app/demo","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T18:16:14.495Z","consecutiveFai